        "title": "Arzette: The Jewel of Faramore",
        "extract": "Arzette: The Jewel of Faramore is a platform game developed by Seedy Eye Software and published by Limited Run Games. It was released on February 14, 2024, for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X/S, and Windows. Arzette is a spiritual successor to the CD-i games Link: The Faces of Evil and Zelda: The Wand of Gamelon.\n\n",
